  "owned_cash_conversion_judgment": [
    "The selected operating recovery produces substantially better accounting profit before it generates common-owner cash. Heavy tooling and supplier/working-capital funding absorb the early improvement; pre-incentive annual cash turns positive in2029 under these assumptions.",
    "The selected2027\u201328 cash deficit is a funding use, not proof of insolvency or automatic equity issuance. Existing cash/investments, refinancing, partner contributions or revised spending can fund it; this exercise does not forecast those transactions or match intra-year maturities.",
    "Collections of already recognized tax receivables improve the early cash trough but do not raise recurring operating earnings. Their selected8B total is a finite balance-sheet realization, not a recurring subsidy rate.",
    "2030 cash improvement depends jointly on product growth, approximate Foundry breakeven and a modest capex taper while D&A rises. This is an execution-dependent recovery forecast, not a conservative floor.",
    "Neither the2030 cash amount nor its gap to the separate34.27B immediate-perpetuity illustration determines a stock recommendation. Recovery may continue beyond2030; further growth requires explicit capital and claims assumptions."
  ],
  "remaining_scope_limits": [
    "Future capital incentives are unestimated, not asserted zero. The pre-incentive line and limited collection overlay are not a complete statutory cash-tax or FCFE forecast.",
    "The NCI reserve is an earnings-anchored approximation of cash belonging to minority owners; actual retention and distribution timing can differ. No additional NCI deduction or partner distribution is made.",
    "No new partner/equity funding is credited. Debt net issuance is held at zero as a financing convention; ordinary interest and cash income are normalized rather than solved from a detailed treasury schedule.",
    "Cash PPE includes financing-classified purchase payments and capitalized interest. Supplier commitments are contained in the combined capital/WC envelope and are not added again.",
    "Existing capital-tax receivables, Secure Enclave share-linked cash and government contingent warrants are distinct. The selected collection overlay includes no escrow-share financing.",
    "Classiq acquisition, other discretionary transactions, debt principal timing and a required minimum-cash reserve are not funding-model inputs here. Cumulative cash need is not a calibrated external-capital requirement.",
    "D&A/inventory absorption and working-capital cash are normalized annual approximations, not a full asset-vintage or inventory rollforward."
  ],
